<title>UK: John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 13.7% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 13.7% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales for the week to September 7 were up 13.7 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>For the six weeks to September 7 department store sales were up 17.3 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>Total sales, including those from the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 13.5 percent year-on-year. For the six-week period, sales were up 13.0 percent.</p>
</text>
